{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日もたくさんの方がきてくださりました（；＿；）！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげさまで能條元気元気です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱみんなの笑顔を見ると幸せな気持ちになる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の服はこーんなだど。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/08/12/3717273/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピースだびよん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"清楚なお嬢さんに見えるってみんな言ってくれたの嬉しかったのー！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会初の伊達メガネちゃんもつけちゃった(*^_^*)にこにこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/08/12/3717273/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛も巻き巻きだぜぇ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしとやか。でしょ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日来てくれたあみあみ族のみんなありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さ！て！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、飛鳥の15歳のお誕生日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15歳かぁ～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき生まれたでしょ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだろーね、改めて言うこと考えるとなんだろーね難しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、まーどちらにしてもね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹みたいなもんよ。本当に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや妹ではないな。友達よりの妹って感じ。え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに年が離れてるのになんでこんな対等に話合うんだろうね。私が幼いの？\nそれとも飛鳥がませてるの？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......どっちもだな。むむ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喧嘩もするけど結局仲良しそれが私達。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎度言ってることだけど愛未はいつでもあんた様の味方だから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だーから大丈夫さー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安心してこれからも生きていきなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/08/12/image.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けけけけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか飛鳥へのメッセージでほとんどこのブログ終わりそうだぜ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだよべつに、べつにそんな飛鳥のこと普通だし別に、別にだしそんな別に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もお仕事がんばるぞーー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えい、えい、おー。"}],"source":"archive"}